Package: argvet
Title: Reusable Argument Validators Evaluated in the Caller's Frame
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuxi", "Yang", , "15364051195@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds validator functions from a block of code. When called,
    a validator collects the arguments and local variables of the calling
    function, evaluates the block in a child environment, and returns the
    possibly normalised values as a named list. Validation logic can be
    defined once and shared across many functions.
